\section{Analysis}
Expanding the expectation gives the variance decomposition
\begin{equation}
\mathrm{Var}(\hat{\theta}) = \frac{1}{n^2} \sum_{i=1}^{n} \mathrm{Var}(X_i) + \frac{2}{n^2} \sum_{i<j} \mathrm{Cov}(X_i, X_j) - \frac{2\bar{c}}{n} \mathrm{Bias}(\hat{\theta}) .
\end{equation}
The display overflows the text width by roughly one third.
